Package: inflatelib-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libinflatelib0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Deflate/Deflate64 decompression library -- development files
 InflateLib is a Deflate/Deflate64 decompression library written in C based
 off dotnet's System.IO.Compression implementation.
 .
 This package provides the headers and development files needed to
 build applications using inflatelib.

Package: libinflatelib0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Deflate/Deflate64 decompression library
 InflateLib is a Deflate/Deflate64 decompression library written in C based
 off dotnet's System.IO.Compression implementation.
 .
 This package provides the shared library needed to run applications
 that link to it.
